NAME
     cloudtelemetryd – Cloud Telemetry Daemon

SYNOPSIS
     cloudtelemetryd

DESCRIPTION
     cloudtelemetryd is a launch daemon for executing handling system-wide
     telemetry events.

     There are no configuration options to cloudtelemetryd. Users should not
     run cloudtelemetryd manually.

